<title>USA: US Treasury refunding details due at 1:45 p.m. EDT.</title>
<headline>US Treasury refunding details due at 1:45 p.m. EDT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Department will release the details of next week's quarterly refunding auctions at 1:45 p.m. (1745 GMT) Wednesday, a spokesman said.</p>
